OL,3,GNEWSAMan accused of fatal dancefloor
OL,4,Apunch 'really sorry'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of delivering a fatal
OL,7,Fpunch on a dancefloor has said he is
OL,8,Fsorry for his actions.
OL,10,FBilly Allison denied murdering Matthew
OL,11,FO'Gara at the Ricco and Loren bar in
OL,12,FLichfield on 24 May but admitted
OL,13,Fmanslaughter.
OL,15,FStafford Crown Court heard the
OL,16,F36-year-old, of Shirley, delivered a
OL,17,F"very, very hard" punch to the
OL,18,F44-year-old pub owner with the "stance
OL,19,Fand skill of an experienced fighter".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
