OL,3,GNEWSAMan accused of fatal dancefloor
OL,4,Apunch 'really sorry'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGiving evidence on Tuesday, Allison
OL,7,Fsaid he was "just really sorry for what
OL,8,FI did that night and really sorry my
OL,9,Factions caused the end of someone's
OL,10,Flife".
